    "content": "\n            <p class=\"mb-4\">Clean rooms are huge energy consumers (10-50 times more than regular offices). The \"Green Clean Room\" trend is becoming a mandatory requirement for factories that want to achieve LEED or LOTUS certification.</p>\n\n            <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-secondary mt-6 mb-3\">1. Reduce pressure difference = Reduce electricity bill</h3>\n            <p class=\"mb-4\">VAF focuses on researching filter lines with aerodynamic design (V-shape) and Mini-pleat technology to reduce wind resistance to the lowest level. By just reducing the pressure difference by 50 Pa, businesses can save hundreds of millions of dong in electricity bills each year for the fan system.</p>\n\n            <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-secondary mt-6 mb-3\">2. Environmentally friendly materials</h3>\n            <p class=\"mb-4\">Product line <strong>V-Dura (ABS plastic frame)</strong> VAF's is a breakthrough in replacing traditional galvanized steel frames:</p>\n            <ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-6 text-slate-700\">\n                <li>50% lighter, reducing transportation costs and CO2 emissions.</li>\n                <li>Can be completely burned after use (Incinerable), leaving no heavy metal waste.</li>\n                <li>Durable, non-corrosive in high humidity environments.</li>\n            </ul>\n        "
